# Document every feature

When you add or change a user-facing feature, API, or ops workflow, update `docs/` in the **same change**. Do not leave documentation for later.

## Required

1. Add or update `docs/features/<kebab-name>.md` using `docs/features/_TEMPLATE.md`.
2. Link it from the table in `docs/README.md`.
3. If run/setup/env changed, also update `docs/run.md` and `docs/architecture.md`.

## What to capture

Behavior, staff vs public access, routes/APIs, important files, and anything a later engineer would miss (share tokens, view counting, Docker ports).

## Do not

- Ship code-only PRs for new features
- Dump implementation notes only in chat
- Rewrite unrelated docs
